# Before the 1pm ET slate -- the week's biggest deadline, and late enough that inactives (T-90min) are out.
# Moved 12:00 -> 12:35 on 2026-09-09: odds-collect-pickem-nfl.timer runs at 12:20, so 12:00 fired TWENTY MINUTES BEFORE the day's collection and read Saturday 23:20 prices -- the week's biggest deadline, measured 12h40m stale. The service now collects first too; this is the belt to that unit's braces, and the only defence if the ExecStartPre is ever dropped.
[Unit]
Description=Pick'em capture: lock-sun
[Timer]
Unit=pickem-capture@lock-sun.service
OnCalendar=Sun *-*-* 12:35:00 America/New_York
RandomizedDelaySec=120
Persistent=true
[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
